    "text": "dear [friend's name],\n\ni hope this letter finds you well. i wanted to reach out and ask you to go and vote in the upcoming election. it's important that everyone has a say in how their community is run, and i believe that voting is one of the best ways to make a difference.\n\ni know that voting can be a bit intimidating, but i want you to know that your voice matters. every vote counts, and your participation can help shape the future of our town.\n\nif you're feeling unsure, i'm here to support you. you don't have to do this alone. you can check your local election office for more information, or you can talk to your neighbors and friends about what's going on.\n\ni hope you'll take the time to vote, and i look forward to hearing from you soon.\n\nwith love and support,  \n[your name]",
